# 基础词 Unit 11 短语

## 常考短语

- **deprive sb of sth**: 剥夺某人某物 — The court deprived him of his parental rights. 法院剥夺了他的监护权。
- **derive from**: 源自 — The word derives from Greek. 这个词源自希腊语。
- **describe...as**: 把…描述为 — She described the experience as life-changing. 她把这段经历描述为改变人生的。
- **deserve to do sth**: 值得做某事 — You deserve to be happy. 你值得拥有幸福。
- **a desire for**: 对…的渴望 — She has a desire for knowledge. 她有对知识的渴望。
- **be desperate for**: 极度渴望 — He was desperate for a job. 他极度渴望一份工作。
- **a popular destination**: 热门目的地 — Paris is a popular tourist destination. 巴黎是热门旅游目的地。
- **determine to do sth**: 下定决心做某事 — She determined to finish the project. 她下定决心完成项目。
- **develop a habit**: 养成习惯 — Reading helps develop good habits. 阅读有助于养成好习惯。
- **devote...to**: 把…奉献给 — He devoted his career to science. 他把职业生涯奉献给了科学。
- **a balanced diet**: 均衡饮食 — A balanced diet is essential for health. 均衡饮食对健康至关重要。
- **a moral dilemma**: 道德困境 — The case presents a moral dilemma. 这个案件提出了一个道德困境。
- **in all dimensions**: 在各方面 — The policy affects society in all dimensions. 该政策在各方面影响社会。
- **a diploma in**: …的文凭 — She has a diploma in nursing. 她有护理学文凭。
- **discriminate against**: 歧视 — It is wrong to discriminate against anyone. 歧视任何人都是错误的。
